  "prCreative": "Get creative!",
  "prDescription": "And as a creator, you set your own price!\nMaybe you create a color blindness config that you want to make free.\nYour altruism won't be punished here: config files are super cheap to store (more on that later).\n\nOr, maybe you spend weeks on a custom gif background and audio pack(s).\nYou would want to be compensated for that work, right? Plus, high quality gif's can take up a bit of space…\n\nTo keep the lights on, we charge everyone 1 USD/month to keep your account active.\nCreators are also (transparently!) billed their costs (storage, transaction, etc).\nBut! That same dollar counts towards your bill.\nPlus, we take 0% (nada, zilch, etc) of your sales. All we do is round up the dollar.\n\nSo, to recap: we make 1.00 USD/month on downloaders, and 0.01-0.99 USD/month on creators.\nAlso, as alluded to: if you didn't create custom art, you'll just be storing a text file.\nCents per month.\n\nWe want creation to have as little friction as possible.\nEspecially for those giving their creations away for free.\n\nFor creators, you will need to keep your account active && balanced.\nBut don't worry, we're not weirdos who'll steal your content if you ever lapse in payment.\nWe'll just remove our copy (and save on server costs) until you're ready to come back.\n\nFor downloaders, all purchased/free content previously downloaded will be available as long as our servers are on.\nYou just won't be able to get new content with an inactive account.",
